      "content": "hey, i've been feeling super low lately because of the weather/lack of sun and i really want to try taking st johns wort to help my mood. i do take the pill for birth control though... i heard some people saying it might mess with it but they sounded like they were just being over-cautious. is it actually a big deal or can i just go ahead and start taking it? i'd rather deal with a natural herb than start actual antidepressants lol",
